      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<section class=\"sr-journal sr-handout\"><p class=\"sr-eyebrow\">STILLROOT'S SONG &nbsp; | &nbsp; PLAYER HANDOUT</p><h1>Resonance notes</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>NAMES</th>\n<th>TRUST</th>\n<th>FLESH</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>First reply</td>\n<td>Second reply</td>\n<td>Third reply</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dampen separately</td>\n<td>Dampen separately</td>\n<td>Dampen separately</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>All three answer -&gt; the central pulse is protected.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>One falls quiet -&gt; one part of the chorus fails.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>All three fall quiet -&gt; the centre can be reached.</strong></p>\n<p>The small crystals repeat the pattern of something larger beneath the well. Follow the cold air behind the roots. The echo leads wherever it wants; the draught must come from somewhere.</p>\n<p>Do not strike the main growth before damping the smaller branches.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>C. Flint</li>\n</ul>\n</section>"
